  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h2><strong>About our brand and products</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://livingoceansaquariums.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong><u>Living Oceans</u></strong></a> creates the world’s simplest, low-maintenance, sustainable marine aquariums for homes and businesses. The Smart Ecosystem Aquarium is more than a fish tank. It is a complete, scientifically designed living ecosystem that makes owning a thriving marine aquarium achievable for everyone.</p><p>Each system includes premium hardware, pre-programmed automation, live fish and corals, and step-by-step guidance. This removes the complexity and uncertainty traditionally associated with marine aquariums.</p><p>We bring joy, calm, and a meaningful connection to nature.<br>Less effort. More joy. A stronger connection to nature.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0898/4631/7366/files/Living_Ecosystem_Aquarium_80L_Black_3.jpg?v=1756186966\" style=\"width:495px;max-width:100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"Living_Ecosystem_Aquarium_80L_Black_3.jpg?v=1756186966\"></p><h2><strong>What makes us different</strong></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Living Oceans is built on a true ecosystem-based approach, designed by scientists so every element works together from day one.</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>A complete aquarium bundle including a living ecosystem</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>Designed for simplicity, stability, and long-term success</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>Low maintenance compared to traditional marine tanks</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>Ethical sourcing with a strong focus on sustainability</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>Living Blocks Reef technology that mimics natural reef systems</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>Online training and optional professional support available</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We remove the research, guesswork, and overwhelm so customers can bring the ocean home.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0898/4631/7366/files/Shopify_Products_10.jpg?v=1764222643\" style=\"width:495px;max-width:100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"Shopify_Products_10.jpg?v=1764222643\"></span><br></p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong>How affiliates can earn</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Affiliates earn commission on successful referrals that lead to the purchase of a Living Oceans Smart Ecosystem Aquarium.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Our aquariums are premium, high-value products, with a minimum commission of $500 per aquarium sold.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">The program suits partners who focus on quality storytelling and engaged audiences. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">As part of our affiliate program, all affiliates are required to complete our online training to ensure accurate and aligned promotion.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">All referrals and commissions are tracked clearly through our affiliate platform.</span></p></div>",
